    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Must consider assets, liabilities, borrowing methods, and finance when categorizing corporations.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) In determining the category in which a corporation is to be included or in determining whether a corporation should be transferred from one category to another category, APRA must have regard to:";
