    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if: (a) an infringement notice is served on a person; and (b) the person has done the act the failure to do which constituted the offence or offences and pays the penalty specified in the notice before the end of the period referred to in paragraph 20(1)(e); and (c) the infringement notice is not withdrawn.";
